{%- comment -%}
  Editorial feature row — three photo cards, built 2026-08-21.

  Reference: `iimages to use/SCREEN.png`, the urbanstems.com 3-up ("Subscribe &
  Save · Same-Day Delivery · Designed to Impress") — full-bleed portrait photo,
  then a centred heading, a short paragraph, and one underlined text link out.
  urbanstems.com is one of the three sites the owner listed in
  `examples/example websites.txt`. The *pattern* is borrowed; the photography,
  the copy and the destinations are ours.

  Each card is a DESTINATION, not a claim — every one links somewhere real
  (delivery page, about page, bouquets collection). That is deliberately a
  different job from the `florista-value-props` icon row, which states three
  reasons and links nowhere. The two still overlap on "delivery" and on
  "arranged by hand"; flagged for the owner in docs/design-log.md rather than
  resolved by silently deleting a brick that was decided in an earlier session.

  Copy holds only facts already settled in CLAUDE.md. Card 1 stopped naming
  the cutoff and the areas on 2026-09-12 (the owner's brief: say the care, not the
  time); it is now a handle-with-care line chosen by the owner from the
  mayan-copy-writer agent's options. Cards 2 and 3 unchanged. No invented
  differentiators, per seo-geo-haifa.

  Photos (from `iimages to use/`, cropped 4:5):
    Delivery guy.jpg     → feature-delivery-*  a real Haifa street, bay and
                           port cranes visible behind the rider. Checked at
                           full resolution for the generated-image tells that
                           got `bike delivery.jpg` rejected last session:
                           licence plates, badges and signage all render as
                           real text here.
    florist working.jpg  → feature-florist-*   cropped to the hands, secateurs
                           and wine-coloured roses — a 6336×2688 frame has no
                           usable 4:5 centre, so this is a tight crop, not a
                           resize.
    LIving room.jpg      → feature-home-*      sage cushions, ivory walls, wine
                           dahlias. Closest thing in the set to the palette.
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'florista-features.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<section class="feat-section">
  <div class="feat-inner">
    <h2 class="visually-hidden">למה פלוריסטה</h2>

    <ul class="feat-grid" role="list">
      <li class="feat-card">
        <div class="feat-media">
          <picture>
            <source
              type="image/webp"
              srcset="
                {{ 'feature-delivery-480.webp' | asset_url }} 480w,
                {{ 'feature-delivery-768.webp' | asset_url }} 768w,
                {{ 'feature-delivery-1024.webp' | asset_url }} 1024w
              "
              sizes="(min-width: 768px) 31vw, 100vw"
            >
            <img
              src="{{ 'feature-delivery-768.jpg' | asset_url }}"
              srcset="
                {{ 'feature-delivery-480.jpg' | asset_url }} 480w,
                {{ 'feature-delivery-768.jpg' | asset_url }} 768w,
                {{ 'feature-delivery-1024.jpg' | asset_url }} 1024w
              "
              sizes="(min-width: 768px) 31vw, 100vw"
              {%- comment -%}
                This alt asserted two things the photograph does not support: that the rider is
                a Florista courier, and that the street is in Haifa. The image is stock. Alt
                text is a description, not a caption we get to write — claiming a stock photo
                depicts our own delivery is the kind of small untruth the helpful-content
                guidance is about, and it is on the delivery feature specifically.

                Narrowed to what is actually in the frame. **The real fix is the owner's photograph**
                — flagged in docs/_gsc/seo-audit-consolidated-2026-08-30.md §G3; replacing the
                asset makes the original alt true and it should go back. 2026-08-30.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              alt="שליח על אופניים עם זר פרחים בתיק המשלוחים"
              width="1843"
              height="2304"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          </picture>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feat-title">{{ section.settings.title_1 | default: 'עד הדלת, באותו יום' }}</h3>
        <p class="feat-text">
          {{-
            section.settings.text_1
            | default: 'כל משלוח נארז בתשומת לב לפרטים ונשלח בעדינות, כדי שיגיע ליעד כמו שהשולח התכוון.'
          -}}
        </p>
        <a class="feat-link" href="{{ section.settings.url_1 | default: '/pages/delivery' }}">
          {{- section.settings.link_1 | default: 'אזורי המשלוח' -}}
        </a>
      </li>

      <li class="feat-card">
        <div class="feat-media">
          <picture>
            <source
              type="image/webp"
              srcset="
                {{ 'feature-florist-480.webp' | asset_url }} 480w,
                {{ 'feature-florist-768.webp' | asset_url }} 768w,
                {{ 'feature-florist-1024.webp' | asset_url }} 1024w
              "
              sizes="(min-width: 768px) 31vw, 100vw"
            >
            <img
              src="{{ 'feature-florist-768.jpg' | asset_url }}"
              srcset="
                {{ 'feature-florist-480.jpg' | asset_url }} 480w,
                {{ 'feature-florist-768.jpg' | asset_url }} 768w,
                {{ 'feature-florist-1024.jpg' | asset_url }} 1024w
              "
              sizes="(min-width: 768px) 31vw, 100vw"
              alt="ידיים מסדרות זר ורדים על שולחן העבודה בחנות הפרחים"
              width="2150"
              height="2688"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          </picture>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feat-title">{{ section.settings.title_2 | default: 'כל זר נשזר באהבה' }}</h3>
        <p class="feat-text">
          {{-
            section.settings.text_2
            | default: 'הזרים מורכבים בחנות הפרחים שלנו בחיפה, בלב שכונת נווה שאנן, פרח אחרי פרח, לפי המקרה והבקשה שלכם.'
          -}}
        </p>
        <a class="feat-link" href="{{ section.settings.url_2 | default: '/pages/about' }}">
          {{- section.settings.link_2 | default: 'הסיפור שלנו' -}}
        </a>
      </li>

      <li class="feat-card">
        <div class="feat-media">
          <picture>
            <source
              type="image/webp"
              srcset="
                {{ 'feature-home-480.webp' | asset_url }} 480w,
                {{ 'feature-home-768.webp' | asset_url }} 768w,
                {{ 'feature-home-1024.webp' | asset_url }} 1024w
              "
              sizes="(min-width: 768px) 31vw, 100vw"
            >
            <img
              src="{{ 'feature-home-768.jpg' | asset_url }}"
              srcset="
                {{ 'feature-home-480.jpg' | asset_url }} 480w,
                {{ 'feature-home-768.jpg' | asset_url }} 768w,
                {{ 'feature-home-1024.jpg' | asset_url }} 1024w
              "
              sizes="(min-width: 768px) 31vw, 100vw"
              alt="זר פרחים באגרטל על שולחן סלון מואר"
              width="1500"
              height="1875"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          </picture>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feat-title">{{ section.settings.title_3 | default: 'הזר שמחכה בבית' }}</h3>
        <p class="feat-text">
          {{-
            section.settings.text_3
            | default: 'לימי הולדת, לאירועים או בלי שום סיבה מיוחדת — זר שנבחר לפי מה שרציתם להגיד.'
          -}}
        </p>
        <a class="feat-link" href="{{ section.settings.url_3 | default: '/collections/bouquets' }}">
          {{- section.settings.link_3 | default: 'לכל הזרים' -}}
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

